        "[Note 39] Romulo B. Lamauig, “Executive–Legislative Relations,” in The Ramos Presidency and Administration: Record and Legacy (1992–1998), eds. Jose V. Abueva/Ma. Concepcion P. Alfiler/Ma. Piva Z. Domingo/Eleanor E. Nicolas (Quezon City: University of the Philippines Press, 1998), p. 60.",
