        "[Note 41] Alfred Stepan and Cindy Skach, “Constitutional Frameworks and Democratic Consolidation: Parliamentarianism versus Presidentialism,” World Politics 46:3 (October 1993), pp. 1–22.",
        "[Note 42] Mainwaring and Shugart, Presidentialism and Democracy, p. 20.",
